-- IAM additions for the API (T-A02, T-A03): platform base roles, privileged role-grant requests, one-time
-- invitation tokens, and two system-realm entry points. Same recipe as 0002/0006: composite tenant keys,
-- apply_tenant_rls, minimal grants.

-- Platform base roles (SEC-25). Generated by renderBaseRoleSeed() in apps/api/src/lib/permissions.ts;
-- apps/api/src/lib/permissions.test.ts fails if this block and the catalogue differ.
